# Personal overrides: copy this file to user.bazelrc (gitignored). BuildBuddy's remote cache for every command,
# and builds (so tests and runs, which inherit build's options) on its executors. The API key goes in ~/.bazelrc:
#   common --remote_header=x-buildbuddy-api-key=<your key>
# Without a key, keep only `common --config=cache` (read-only cache; BuildBuddy's executors need one).
common --config=cache
build --config=rbe
